    "Have in your inventory 4 × Elite Logistical Transporter (mekanism:elite_logistical_transporter). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012EFE0DAF95C.title": "Obtain 4 × Advanced Mechanical Pipe",
  "quest.513011A804CB36C0.title": "Obtain 4 × Advanced Mechanical Pipe",
