  "chapter.514D10901AD244ED.title": "08 · Fission, Fusion and High Energy",
  "chapter.514D10901AD244ED.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Prepare the site, waste handling and fuel line before the first cycle. Separate branches lead to the turbine, energy matrix, fusion and SPS; liquid chemical samples remain optional.",
    "60 quests · 9 sequential production sections.",
    "Read top to bottom · hover a quest to see all its connections",
    "Open a quest to inspect all prerequisites, including links to other chapters. Item tasks check inventory; the description explains assembly and a test run."
  ],
  "task.514D12BA1F51A522.title": "Unfashionable, But Smart",
  "task.514D12B4090E19E6.title": "Obtain 1 × Dosimeter",
  "task.514D12010AA0C57A.title": "Obtain 1 × Geiger Counter",
  "quest.514D11FDEEB7D32B.title": "Prepare the nuclear site",
  "quest.514D11FDEEB7D32B.quest_desc": [
    "This route goes from protective equipment and measurements to cooled fission, steam recovery and waste processing. Prepare a Dosimeter and Geiger Counter, then plan the waste output. The side advancements for radiation exposure are not needed to start the reactor."
  ],
  "task.514D12AB1097E194.title": "Obtain 4 × Radioactive Waste Barrel",
  "quest.514D1138F546A4D2.title": "A dedicated radioactive waste output",
  "quest.514D1138F546A4D2.quest_desc": [
    "Connect Radioactive Waste Barrels to the reactor's waste output and reserve capacity. Verify ports and chemical transport before feeding fuel, and monitor the output so a full buffer is noticed."
  ],
  "task.514D12993A901080.title": "30 × Fission Reactor Casing — not consumed",
  "task.514D12CC105A6C1B.title": "4 × Fission Reactor Port — not consumed",
  "task.514D12DF5AAE9F26.title": "1 × Fission Fuel Assembly — not consumed",
  "task.514D129CF4D28851.title": "1 × Control Rod Assembly — not consumed",
  "quest.514D11CD9798EC9F.title": "Fission Reactor: Shell and Fuel Assembly",
  "quest.514D11CD9798EC9F.quest_desc": [
    "Minimum fission reactor: 3×4×3. Its 34 shell positions are 30 Fission Reactor Casings and four Ports. Inside, place one Fuel Assembly and a Control Rod Assembly directly above it.",
    "Use separate ports for fuel, water, steam and waste; configure outputs with a Configurator. The following quest adds a shutdown Logic Adapter in place of one casing.",
    "This quest gathers the construction kit. The operating cycle is checked separately after coolant, fuel and waste handling are ready.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one."
  ],
  "task.514D122B1B1155E6.title": "Obtain 2 × Electric Pump",
  "task.514D126191337D7E.title": "Obtain 8 × Elite Mechanical Pipe",
  "task.514D12FD3660093C.title": "Obtain 1 × Fission Reactor Logic Adapter",
  "task.514D124717B8D25F.title": "Manual check: Cooling before Ignition",
  "quest.514D1144187ECDB7.title": "Cooling and shutdown first",
  "quest.514D1144187ECDB7.quest_desc": [
    "Supply sufficient water, provide a steam output and configure the Fission Reactor Logic Adapter. Check cooling and your shutdown method before confirming the manual objective. Holding the pump and pipes alone does not demonstrate a working circuit."
  ],
  "task.514D12A42566D693.title": "Obtain 1 × Chemical Oxidizer",
  "task.514D1269E71BD6DD.title": "Obtain 1 × Isotopic Centrifuge",
  "task.514D12915E27C6EA.title": "Obtain 8 × Yellow Cake Uranium",
  "quest.514D1193C52093DB.title": "Uranium → chemical line → fuel",
  "quest.514D1193C52093DB.quest_desc": [
    "Yellow Cake Uranium passes through oxidation and further chemistry to Uranium Hexafluoride, which the Isotopic Centrifuge turns into Fissile Fuel. Prepare the fluorite and sulfur reagent lines and inspect the sequence in JEI. The side quests for liquid buckets are optional samples, not requirements for transporting fuel."
  ],
  "task.514D122A765B9623.title": "Automatic: A Controlled First Fission Cycle",
  "quest.514D11FF5A4363E6.title": "A controlled first fission cycle",
  "quest.514D11FF5A4363E6.quest_desc": [
    "Prepare coolant, steam and waste outputs, and a reliable way to shut down the Fission Reactor. To start the automatic observation, right-click a Fission Reactor Casing on the formed reactor with your main hand without holding Shift.",
    "Remain in the same dimension within 16 blocks of the block you clicked. Maintain at least 10 seconds of operation (200 server ticks): the reactor is active and burns fuel, its temperature stays below 1200 K, damage remains zero, and its fluid or chemical coolant tank is not empty.",
    "Then shut down the reactor and wait for fuel burning to stop while retaining coolant, a temperature below 1200 K and zero damage. The quest completes after this normal shutdown; at normal server speed, observation runs once per second.",
    "Moving beyond 16 blocks, changing dimension, leaving the world or dismantling the reactor interrupts observation. After returning, right-click the formed casing again and perform the complete cycle."
  ],
  "task.514D12AF3D607032.title": "44 × Turbine Casing — not consumed",
  "task.5150127B40B826E0.title": "51 × Structural Glass — not consumed",
  "task.514D12E69CE54212.title": "2 × Turbine Valve — not consumed",
  "task.515012CD142BD3F0.title": "1 × Turbine Vent — not consumed",
  "task.514D120323B4B81B.title": "1 × Turbine Rotor — not consumed",
  "task.5150121596D3034D.title": "1 × Turbine Blade — not consumed",
  "task.514D12C6792999DA.title": "1 × Rotational Complex — not consumed",
  "task.515012C90D3B9818.title": "8 × Pressure Disperser — not consumed",
  "task.514D1286E7C55331.title": "1 × Electromagnetic Coil — not consumed",
  "quest.514D111250CFCDBB.title": "Mekanism Turbine: Minimum Kit",
  "quest.514D111250CFCDBB.quest_desc": [
    "Smallest working Mekanism turbine: 5×5×5. Its frame uses 44 Turbine Casings; the rest of the shell is 51 Structural Glass, two Valves and one Vent. Place the Vent at the Rotational Complex’s height or above.",
    "Above the floor centre, place one Rotor with one Blade. Put the Rotational Complex above it and fill the surrounding interior layer with eight Pressure Dispersers. Put one Electromagnetic Coil directly above the Complex.",
    "One Valve accepts steam; the other outputs FE. This is a small starter rig. Add a Saturating Condenser for water recovery and more blades after assembly; match steam input to the turbine’s actual throughput.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one."
  ],
  "task.514D12CB89E7E7C9.title": "Obtain 1 × Solar Neutron Activator",
  "task.514D12C878F5C52C.title": "Obtain 1 × Pressurized Reaction Chamber",
  "task.514D12056A2F6A8C.title": "Obtain 1 × Polonium Pellet",
  "quest.514D1127DFAD1A15.title": "Waste → polonium",
  "quest.514D1127DFAD1A15.quest_desc": [
    "The Solar Neutron Activator converts nuclear waste into polonium, and the Pressurized Reaction Chamber completes the pellet recipe with its additional inputs. Keep separate lines and buffers for radioactive chemicals; this material leads to later systems."
  ],
  "task.514D129127C145B1.title": "Obtain 1 × Plutonium Pellet",
  "quest.514D11E025B689EF.title": "Another waste route: plutonium",
  "quest.514D11E025B689EF.quest_desc": [
    "Plutonium uses another nuclear waste processing branch. Check its chemical sequence and pellet recipe in JEI, then direct part of the flow into the late components that need it. This does not replace reactor waste handling or cooling."
  ],
  "task.513012FA6DF56D43.title": "Oops, Did I Do That?",
