  "chapter.514D108CCEEB811A.title": "17 · Apotheosis: The Equipment Workshop",
  "chapter.514D108CCEEB811A.chapter_subtitle": [
    "50 quests · English objective guide (alpha).",
    "Short lines: sequence · hover a quest: other prerequisites",
    "Open a quest to inspect all prerequisites. Its map role does not change its completion conditions."
  ],
  "task.514D124751D88548.title": "Obtain 1 × Enchanting Table",
  "task.514D12CF841E147B.title": "The Basics",
  "quest.514D11521F7911EE.title": "Obtain 1 × Enchanting Table + The Basics",
  "quest.514D11521F7911EE.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Enchanting Table (minecraft:enchanting_table). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Earn the native advancement The Basics (apothic_enchanting:30ench). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.514D12472B78081E.title": "World Tier: Haven",
  "quest.514D11784324BCC0.title": "World Tier: Haven",
  "quest.514D11784324BCC0.quest_desc": [
    "Earn the native advancement World Tier: Haven (apotheosis:progression/haven). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.514D12A03BB0C135.title": "Obtain 1 × Salvaging Table",
  "task.514D1266DF288AE7.title": "Obtain 1 × Simple Reforging Table",
  "quest.514D11649778EA6D.title": "Obtain 1 × Salvaging Table + Obtain 1 × Simple Reforging Table",
  "quest.514D11649778EA6D.quest_desc": [
    "Start with a salvage loop: break down unwanted affix equipment in the Salvaging Table to obtain its rarity material. Inspect the item’s properties first, because salvaging consumes it.",
    "In the Simple Reforging Table, place equipment in the center, the desired rarity material in the upper-left slot and Sigils of Rebirth in the lower-right slot. You also need experience levels. This table supports rarities up to and including Rare.",
    "Reforging can add affixes to valid ordinary equipment or replace an existing affix set. Compare the three offered outcomes: the more expensive choice does not guarantee a better set for your build."
  ],
  "task.514D127A983D6185.title": "Mastering Hell and Sea",
  "quest.514D11E79566207A.title": "Mastering Hell and Sea",
  "quest.514D11E79566207A.quest_desc": [
    "Earn the native advancement Mastering Hell and Sea (apothic_enchanting:60ench). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.514D12E1828CB629.title": "Obtain 1 × Gem Cutting Table",
  "task.514D126F385906DA.title": "Obtain 4 × Gem Dust",
  "quest.514D114DC1B13CA4.title": "Obtain 1 × Gem Cutting Table + Obtain 4 × Gem Dust",
  "quest.514D114DC1B13CA4.quest_desc": [
    "Obtain your first Gem Dust by dropping an unwanted Apotheosis gem into the world and letting an Anvil block fall onto it. Once you have a Salvaging Table, use it to break down spare gems. This quest requires four Gem Dust as well as the Gem Cutting Table.",
    "Gem cutting raises a gem’s purity. Upgrades usually require Gem Dust, a rarity material and a second gem of the same purity. Before spending materials, read the bonus for your intended equipment type: one gem can provide different effects in different items."
  ],
  "task.514D1254899B7CFB.title": "World Tier: Frontier",
  "quest.514D11268DEDBF9A.title": "World Tier: Frontier",
  "quest.514D11268DEDBF9A.quest_desc": [
    "Earn the native advancement World Tier: Frontier (apotheosis:progression/frontier). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.514D123AE7C7C715.title": "World Tier: Ascent",
  "quest.514D11053C24F796.title": "World Tier: Ascent",
  "quest.514D11053C24F796.quest_desc": [
    "Earn the native advancement World Tier: Ascent (apotheosis:progression/ascent). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.514D129E169F51C5.title": "Obtain 1 × Reforging Table",
  "quest.514D11E8DD1AE2CE.title": "Obtain 1 × Reforging Table",
  "quest.514D11E8DD1AE2CE.quest_desc": [
    "The full Reforging Table unlocks Epic and higher-rarity reforging. Its SOQM recipe consumes the Simple Reforging Table and requires Arcane Sands, Netherite, Refined Obsidian, an Arcane Conduit and a Control Assembly; prepare the components before dismantling your old station.",
    "Like the simple table, it needs a rarity material, Sigils of Rebirth and experience to operate. Reforging generates a new affix set. To change one affix while keeping the others, progress to the Augmenting Table."
  ],
  "task.513012ABCFDB8AB4.title": "Obtain 1 × Mysterious Scrap Metal",
  "quest.513011F4018BF0E3.title": "Obtain 1 × Mysterious Scrap Metal",
  "quest.513011F4018BF0E3.quest_desc": [
    "Obtain Mysterious Scrap Metal by salvaging Common equipment in the Salvaging Table. It is the first rarity material in the spare-loot-to-reforging loop: place it in the Simple Reforging Table’s material slot and add Sigils of Rebirth."
  ],
  "task.513012D1C8E18313.title": "Obtain 1 × Timeworn Fabric",
  "quest.513011E1CCD81700.title": "Obtain 1 × Timeworn Fabric",
  "quest.513011E1CCD81700.quest_desc": [
    "Timeworn Fabric comes from salvaging Uncommon equipment in the Salvaging Table. Read the item’s rarity in its tooltip; armor material or ordinary enchantments alone do not establish that rarity.",
    "Keep the fabric for Uncommon reforging and gem upgrades that require this material tier. Use spare equipment for salvage so you can retain the gear you still rely on."
  ],
  "task.5130126E5F088984.title": "Obtain 1 × Luminous Crystal Shard",
  "quest.5130115B35EE7BCB.title": "Obtain 1 × Luminous Crystal Shard",
  "quest.5130115B35EE7BCB.quest_desc": [
    "Obtain Luminous Crystal Shards by salvaging Rare equipment. These are Apotheosis rarity materials; mining quartz or amethyst does not replace this step.",
    "Rare is the highest rarity supported by the Simple Reforging Table. Combine the shards with Sigils of Rebirth and experience to prepare equipment for harder expeditions."
  ],
  "task.51301263E3F8D376.title": "Obtain 1 × Arcane Sands",
  "quest.513011B18FB3384D.title": "Obtain 1 × Arcane Sands",
  "quest.513011B18FB3384D.quest_desc": [
    "Arcane Sands come from Epic equipment salvaged in the Salvaging Table. Reserve at least two for the full Reforging Table recipe in SOQM.",
    "The material enables Epic reforging, which requires the full table. If your Simple Reforging Table will not accept it, upgrade the station first."
  ],
  "task.5130124ACAC99498.title": "Obtain 1 × Godforged Pearl",
  "quest.51301175D0C8E4CE.title": "Obtain 1 × Godforged Pearl",
  "quest.51301175D0C8E4CE.quest_desc": [
    "Obtain a Godforged Pearl by salvaging Mythic equipment in the Salvaging Table. Compare its affixes with your current loadout first: obtaining the pearl costs the equipment itself.",
    "Reserve two pearls for an Augmenting Table. That station lets you work on individual affixes and complements ordinary equipment reforging."
  ],
  "task.51301210788EE2D1.title": "Obtain 1 × Basic Bookshelf",
  "quest.51301195B708D449.title": "Obtain 1 × Basic Bookshelf",
  "quest.51301195B708D449.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Basic Bookshelf (apothic_enchanting:basic_bookshelf). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012E4A3886C2C.title": "Obtain 1 × Stoneshelf",
  "quest.5130117D1CEC7C24.title": "Obtain 1 × Stoneshelf",
  "quest.5130117D1CEC7C24.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Stoneshelf (apothic_enchanting:stoneshelf). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130121A2249F9D0.title": "Obtain 1 × Hellshelf",
  "quest.5130112B3AC1A096.title": "Obtain 1 × Hellshelf",
  "quest.5130112B3AC1A096.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Hellshelf (apothic_enchanting:hellshelf). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
