  "chapter.513010B66DB664B5.title": "03 · Steel, Wires and Heavy Industry",
  "chapter.513010B66DB664B5.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Start with a hammer and Coke Oven. Coke leads to steel, creosote to treated planks; combine them with wire and a component for the first chassis. Then choose water or wind power, prepare transport and build the production machines you need.",
    "65 quests · 8 sequential production sections.",
    "Read top to bottom · hover a quest to see all its connections",
    "Open a quest to inspect all prerequisites, including links to other chapters. Item tasks check inventory; the description explains assembly and a test run."
  ],
  "task.513012B0B11E56E5.title": "Obtain 1 × Engineer's Hammer",
  "quest.51301140C9328072.title": "Obtain 1 × Engineer's Hammer",
  "quest.51301140C9328072.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Engineer's Hammer (immersiveengineering:hammer). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012852F42A95C.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Plate",
  "quest.51301167DCA596B9.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Plate",
  "quest.51301167DCA596B9.quest_desc": [
    "Steel plates feed the Industrial Chassis recipe and workshop construction. Make them from finished steel; an iron plate does not replace a steel plate in this route.",
    "Use the hammer recipe for the first batch. Once demand becomes steady, move the operation to a Metal Press with a plate mold so one line supplies subsequent machines."
  ],
  "task.513012E93A2BDBCD.title": "Obtain 1 × Treated Wood Planks",
  "quest.5130117FBB68BE2D.title": "Obtain 1 × Treated Wood Planks",
  "quest.5130117FBB68BE2D.quest_desc": [
    "Treated wood is ordinary planks impregnated with creosote from the Coke Oven. It is used in the Industrial Chassis and engineering structures, so keep the oven’s liquid by-product.",
    "First collect creosote in a suitable container and make a small batch of planks. For continuous production, arrange extraction into a tank: the oven does not automatically push creosote into an ordinary pipe."
  ],
  "task.513012C9A2C9C87E.title": "Obtain 1 × Iron Mechanical Component",
  "quest.513011D0113472B0.title": "Obtain 1 × Iron Mechanical Component",
  "quest.513011D0113472B0.quest_desc": [
    "The Iron Mechanical Component is a crafting part, not a working machine. It is used in the Industrial Chassis and early Immersive Engineering devices.",
    "Reserve the components needed for your next chassis before spending the rest on optional equipment. The steel component has different uses; a higher material tier does not make it interchangeable in recipes."
  ],
  "task.5150128180ECAB4E.title": "27 × Coke Brick — not consumed",
  "task.515012F7B8775651.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.5130120D07D7C274.title": "Concentrated Carbon",
  "quest.51301157FF888779.title": "Build a Coke Oven",
  "quest.51301157FF888779.quest_desc": [
    "Coke Oven construction kit: the fixed 3×3×3 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "The Coke Oven supplies coke for steelmaking and creosote for treated wood. Build a solid 3×3×3 cube of 27 Cokebricks, then use the Engineer’s Hammer on the centre block of a side. Forming the multiblock completes this task.",
    "For the first run, insert coal and collect both products. The oven is slow and supports batches; arrange creosote extraction before scaling up, because it does not push that fluid out by itself."
  ],
  "task.51501288F4365929.title": "27 × Blast Brick — not consumed",
  "task.5150128A9E460C23.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.513012C0487968AE.title": "Really Hot Topic",
  "quest.513011AE9CF26AB0.title": "Form the Blast Furnace",
  "quest.513011AE9CF26AB0.quest_desc": [
    "Blast Furnace construction kit: the fixed 3×3×3 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "The Crude Blast Furnace turns iron into steel. Build a solid 3×3×3 cube of 27 Blast Bricks and form it with the hammer on the centre block of a side; the task detects formation.",
    "Operation needs iron and a supported high-carbon fuel such as Coal Coke. Remove both steel and slag: a full by-product slot stops the process. This early furnace is operated manually; use the Improved Blast Furnace for automated input and output."
  ],
  "task.513012CE359E1E93.title": "Birds on a Wire",
  "quest.513011518B793203.title": "Birds on a Wire",
  "quest.513011518B793203.quest_desc": [
    "Place two connectors of the same voltage tier and use the matching wire coil on them in sequence. An actual connection earns the advancement; carrying the coil does not.",
    "To test power, attach a Connector to the source output and another to the consumer input. A Relay only joins wires and does not transfer energy into its supporting block. Keep the wire path clear because an obstruction breaks the connection."
  ],
  "task.515012EBB01C6F37.title": "8 × Kiln Brick — not consumed",
  "task.515012BE5C957D2C.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.513012A360ACAF64.title": "Form the Alloy Smelter",
  "quest.513011FFA590DC5D.title": "Form the Alloy Smelter",
  "quest.513011FFA590DC5D.quest_desc": [
    "Alloy Kiln construction kit: the fixed 2×2×2 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "The Alloy Kiln opens early metal mixing, including electrum and constantan. Build a 2×2×2 cube of eight Kiln Bricks and form it with the Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The task detects formation. Test operation separately by inserting both metals from one supported recipe and fuel, then collecting the alloy. This kiln is not a blast furnace and does not replace the steelmaking process."
  ],
  "task.513012E032B69C3B.title": "Obtain 1 × Engineer's Manual",
  "quest.5130110C9CAE442B.title": "Obtain 1 × Engineer's Manual",
  "quest.5130110C9CAE442B.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Engineer's Manual (immersiveengineering:manual). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.51301247069308A7.title": "Obtain 1 × Engineer's Wire Cutters",
  "quest.513011A899EC23A8.title": "Obtain 1 × Engineer's Wire Cutters",
  "quest.513011A899EC23A8.quest_desc": [
    "Engineer’s Wire Cutters are used in wire-part recipes and to remove installed wiring. They let you rebuild the network without breaking the machine beneath a connector.",
    "Right-clicking a connector with the cutters removes its connected wires. Check which branches depend on that connection first, because one junction can supply several consumers."
  ],
  "task.51301230064205D8.title": "Obtain 1 × Engineer's Screwdriver",
  "quest.51301113A3154D2A.title": "Obtain 1 × Engineer's Screwdriver",
  "quest.51301113A3154D2A.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Engineer's Screwdriver (immersiveengineering:screwdriver). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012549973E305.title": "Obtain 1 × Coke Brick",
  "quest.5130115B313C6A81.title": "Obtain 1 × Coke Brick",
  "quest.5130115B313C6A81.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Coke Brick (immersiveengineering:cokebrick). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130123979886834.title": "Obtain 1 × Coal Coke",
  "quest.5130114F2594B696.title": "Obtain 1 × Coal Coke",
  "quest.5130114F2594B696.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Coal Coke (immersiveengineering:coal_coke). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.51301283E5880FA7.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Mechanical Component",
  "quest.51301169A78021F0.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Mechanical Component",
  "quest.51301169A78021F0.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Steel Mechanical Component (immersiveengineering:component_steel). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130121BDCB21F2C.title": "Obtain 1 × Kinetic Dynamo",
  "quest.5130112227C31308.title": "Obtain 1 × Kinetic Dynamo",
  "quest.5130112227C31308.quest_desc": [
    "The Kinetic Dynamo converts a Water Wheel or Windmill’s rotation into electricity. Place the dynamo first, then attach the wheel or windmill to its shaft.",
    "Connect its energy output to a capacitor or machine and check that charge increases. A dynamo without rotation generates nothing, and an arbitrary shaft from another mod is not a supported drive."
  ],
  "task.513012624AEF8EA3.title": "Obtain 1 × Water Wheel",
  "quest.5130114CEA71331A.title": "Obtain 1 × Water Wheel",
  "quest.5130114CEA71331A.quest_desc": [
    "A Water Wheel supplies steady rotation to a Kinetic Dynamo. Mount it on the shaft of an already placed dynamo and arrange flowing water around the wheel in a consistent direction.",
    "Check output through capacitor charge rather than animation alone. Up to three wheels can share one shaft; an extra wheel without suitable water flow does not replace a properly arranged water route."
  ],
  "task.513012EDD25679DD.title": "Obtain 1 × Windmill",
  "quest.513011647FD31AF9.title": "Obtain 1 × Windmill",
  "quest.513011647FD31AF9.quest_desc": [
    "A Windmill drives the Kinetic Dynamo without consuming fuel. Attach it to the dynamo and keep the space in front of its blades clear; a wall obstructing the airflow reduces output.",
    "Apply Windmill Sails by right-clicking the windmill to improve it. Add a capacitor for an uneven workshop load: generation depends on conditions and does not guarantee continuous power for a large machine."
  ],
  "task.513012165EB8196A.title": "Obtain 1 × LV Wire Coil",
  "quest.513011B6D00A0F88.title": "Obtain 1 × LV Wire Coil",
  "quest.513011B6D00A0F88.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × LV Wire Coil (immersiveengineering:wirecoil_copper). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130123125309CC5.title": "Obtain 1 × LV Wire Connector",
  "quest.5130116C6548DD6D.title": "Obtain 1 × LV Wire Connector",
  "quest.5130116C6548DD6D.quest_desc": [
    "An LV Connector is an input or output for a low-voltage wire network. Attach it to an energy-capable face of a source or machine and connect it to another connector using a copper LV coil.",
    "If the machine does not charge, check the block face and wire tier. A similar-looking Relay cannot feed the machine, and MV wire cannot connect to an LV Connector."
  ],
  "task.513012F5B4681A8E.title": "Obtain 1 × LV Wire Relay",
  "quest.513011F3D9FACD30.title": "Obtain 1 × LV Wire Relay",
  "quest.513011F3D9FACD30.quest_desc": [
    "An LV Relay creates branches and turns along wiring between distant machines. Mount it on a support and attach matching LV wires.",
    "Keep Connectors at the source and consumer: a Relay only joins wires. Combining many consumers does not increase the current a single wire can carry; an overloaded line can burn out."
  ],
  "task.513012F7E46E8159.title": "Obtain 1 × LV Accumulator",
  "quest.5130113060E2375A.title": "Obtain 1 × LV Accumulator",
  "quest.5130113060E2375A.quest_desc": [
    "The LV Capacitor stores surplus generation and supplies it during workshop demand peaks. Configure faces with the hammer: blue is input, orange is output, and an unmarked face is disabled.",
    "Feed the blue face and connect the machine to the orange face. First verify charging without the consumer, then enable the load; the capacitor stores energy but does not generate it."
  ],
  "task.513012E478668D9D.title": "Obtain 1 × MV Wire Coil",
  "quest.5130110029567322.title": "Medium-voltage wire coil",
  "quest.5130110029567322.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × MV Wire Coil (immersiveengineering:wirecoil_electrum). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012F026C116EE.title": "Obtain 1 × MV Wire Connector",
  "quest.51301192F84C0562.title": "Obtain 1 × MV Wire Connector",
  "quest.51301192F84C0562.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × MV Wire Connector (immersiveengineering:connector_mv). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5150126716E5F5D7.title": "1 × Redstone Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.5150121453A9ACB7.title": "1 × Piston — not consumed",
  "task.5150127B8FA7807A.title": "1 × Heavy Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.51501273C1E31FA2.title": "2 × Steel Scaffolding — not consumed",
  "task.51501222CEE28D97.title": "2 × Conveyor Belt — not consumed",
  "task.515012186FD0F575.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.513012F20639C243.title": "Pressing Matters",
  "quest.51301173D68FCBFF.title": "Pressing Matters",
  "quest.51301173D68FCBFF.quest_desc": [
    "Metal Press construction kit: the fixed 3×3×1 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "The Metal Press automates plates, rods and other metal parts. Build the structure shown in the Engineer’s Manual and use the hammer on its piston; formation completes the quest.",
    "To operate it, right-click with the required mold, feed power through the top connector and send material onto the input conveyor. A formed press without a mold cannot process ingots. Give the output conveyor somewhere with free storage space to deliver them."
  ],
  "task.515012D71550BEDF.title": "10 × Light Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.51501220AD41CDE3.title": "1 × Redstone Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.515012C9D7E35532.title": "10 × Steel Scaffolding — not consumed",
  "task.515012B2275A6869.title": "8 × Steel Fence — not consumed",
  "task.5150124F03D3F417.title": "9 × Hopper — not consumed",
  "task.5150123862D8BCB2.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.513012128B6F112B.title": "Hazardous Machinery",
  "quest.513011EE444C38AF.title": "Hazardous Machinery",
  "quest.513011EE444C38AF.quest_desc": [
    "Crusher construction kit: the fixed 5×3×3 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "The Crusher converts suitable solid ingredients into crushed products. Form the multiblock from the Engineer’s Manual, connect power and place an output receiver before feeding it.",
    "The quest checks construction. Test operation by feeding one small batch through the input and collecting the main product and any by-product. Keep clear of the intake and do not send valuable items into it without a matching recipe."
  ],
  "task.51501280A390D45C.title": "27 × Reinforced Blast Brick — not consumed",
  "task.5150122B1024ED76.title": "1 × Hopper — not consumed",
  "task.5150129433F70F2D.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.5130120E1B154BF5.title": "Next Level Blasting",
  "quest.513011965BAF66F4.title": "Next Level Blasting",
  "quest.513011965BAF66F4.quest_desc": [
    "Improved Blast Furnace construction kit: the fixed 3×4×3 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "The Improved Blast Furnace adds automated input and output to steelmaking. Build the reinforced-brick structure with its top hopper from the manual and form it with the hammer.",
    "Feed iron and coke from above. Steel exits at the front and slag at the back, so provide both receivers. Up to two Preheaters attach to its side ports, but each needs an electrical supply."
  ],
  "task.515012D289100AB3.title": "4 × Light Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.515012888884D8E6.title": "4 × Iron Sheetmetal — not consumed",
  "task.5150124927825385.title": "1 × Redstone Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.515012CD81DC2414.title": "5 × Steel Scaffolding — not consumed",
  "task.51501242CCECE9AD.title": "1 × Steel Fence — not consumed",
  "task.515012BF83A149D3.title": "3 × Fluid Pipe — not consumed",
  "task.515012A682792880.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.513012E23F6264C8.title": "Industrial Potionmaking",
  "quest.513011027911756D.title": "Industrial Potionmaking",
  "quest.513011027911756D.quest_desc": [
    "Mixer construction kit: the fixed 3×3×3 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "Earn the native advancement Industrial Potionmaking (immersiveengineering:multiblocks/mb_mixer). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.515012375514EEFE.title": "50 × Iron Sheetmetal — not consumed",
  "task.515012C431611626.title": "4 × Treated Wood Fence — not consumed",
  "task.515012161AD02A0D.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.513012579FFB2F5F.title": "Sheetmetal Stash",
  "quest.513011306BCB6E37.title": "Sheetmetal Stash",
  "quest.513011306BCB6E37.quest_desc": [
    "Silo construction kit: the fixed 3×7×3 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "Earn the native advancement Sheetmetal Stash (immersiveengineering:multiblocks/mb_silo). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.515012C2155F9A75.title": "34 × Iron Sheetmetal — not consumed",
  "task.5150128F2FC26C5D.title": "4 × Treated Wood Fence — not consumed",
  "task.515012FCD29CDC7A.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.5130128E444F0E77.title": "Water Tower",
  "quest.51301103F035DDAB.title": "Water Tower",
  "quest.51301103F035DDAB.quest_desc": [
    "Sheetmetal Tank construction kit: the fixed 3×5×3 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "Earn the native advancement Water Tower (immersiveengineering:multiblocks/mb_tank). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.5130129740265F03.title": "X Marks the Spot",
  "quest.513011F8C15E22E3.title": "X Marks the Spot",
  "quest.513011F8C15E22E3.quest_desc": [
    "Earn the native advancement X Marks the Spot (immersiveengineering:main/buy_oremap). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.515012C43204459C.title": "2 × Redstone Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.5150123F59DE1C8A.title": "2 × Light Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.51501250ECF5AB86.title": "9 × Iron Sheetmetal — not consumed",
  "task.51501271AB7E3F44.title": "6 × Steel Scaffolding — not consumed",
  "task.515012453F926337.title": "6 × Iron Sheetmetal Slab — not consumed",
  "task.5150123E85631F6C.title": "2 × Conveyor Belt — not consumed",
  "task.5150124296C71E0B.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.513012851ED39119.title": "Form the Assembler",
  "quest.5130111A675CD3CC.title": "Form the Assembler",
  "quest.5130111A675CD3CC.quest_desc": [
    "Assembler construction kit: the fixed 3×3×3 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "The Assembler performs up to three stored recipes in sequence and can use an earlier result in the next recipe. Form the structure from the manual to satisfy the quest.",
    "For the first test, configure one recipe, put materials in the lower input slots and supply power from above. The recipe grids describe the craft rather than supply its ingredients. Fluid recipes also need filled internal tanks."
  ],
  "task.5150125CA63A55D2.title": "2 × Iron Sheetmetal — not consumed",
  "task.515012CEED304F7F.title": "1 × Redstone Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.515012C3A8F8D7AC.title": "2 × Light Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.515012D649E272CC.title": "3 × Steel Scaffolding — not consumed",
  "task.515012AEAB59DE2F.title": "3 × Conveyor Belt — not consumed",
  "task.515012E2DEBAE4A8.title": "2 × Fluid Pump — not consumed",
  "task.515012AD271CC9E7.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.513012B9ADCF9871.title": "Form the Bottling Machine",
  "quest.513011585394EA3D.title": "Form the Bottling Machine",
  "quest.513011585394EA3D.quest_desc": [
    "Bottling Machine construction kit: the fixed 3×3×2 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "Build the Immersive Engineering Bottling Machine using the Engineer's Manual, then form it with the Engineer's Hammer. Possessing its components alone does not count."
  ],
  "task.515012DC51BEA40B.title": "6 × Light Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.5150123B5997F57F.title": "4 × Iron Sheetmetal — not consumed",
  "task.515012F995EBCD82.title": "2 × Heavy Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.515012F3D808F990.title": "1 × Redstone Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.515012430ABBB044.title": "8 × Steel Scaffolding — not consumed",
  "task.5150120B8F95157C.title": "4 × Conveyor Belt — not consumed",
  "task.5150124241A40BBD.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.513012FF49270C51.title": "Form the Sawmill",
  "quest.513011CA9536C271.title": "Form the Sawmill",
  "quest.513011CA9536C271.quest_desc": [
    "Sawmill construction kit: the fixed 5×3×3 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "Build the Immersive Engineering Sawmill using the Engineer's Manual, then form it with the Engineer's Hammer. Possessing its components alone does not count."
  ],
  "task.51501249830478E2.title": "4 × Light Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.5150121B9432D166.title": "1 × Redstone Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.515012499EBB2559.title": "2 × Heavy Engineering Block — not consumed",
  "task.5150122E21E89E81.title": "5 × Steel Scaffolding — not consumed",
  "task.5150121A146BD19B.title": "2 × Treated Wood Slab — not consumed",
  "task.5150123294C06991.title": "4 × Conveyor Belt — not consumed",
  "task.5150127720585530.title": "1 × Engineer's Hammer — not consumed",
  "task.513012BAB0B461A4.title": "Form the Auto Workbench",
  "quest.513011D0F247BDDA.title": "Form the Auto Workbench",
  "quest.513011D0F247BDDA.quest_desc": [
    "Automated Workbench construction kit: the fixed 3×2×3 layout. Tasks list every construction block and one reusable Engineer’s Hammer.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "The Automated Workbench automates products from engineering blueprints. After formation, place the required Blueprint on its table and select a result; an arbitrary 3×3 crafting grid does not replace the blueprint.",
    "Feed materials through the blue-marked hatches and power above them; finished parts leave the conveyor end. The quest detects formation, so follow it with a real production cycle and an output receiver."
  ],
  "task.51301215317FF090.title": "Obtain 1 × MV Accumulator",
  "quest.5130115247ECD3E2.title": "Obtain 1 × MV Accumulator",
  "quest.5130115247ECD3E2.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × MV Accumulator (immersiveengineering:capacitor_mv). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130126FA050F752.title": "Obtain 1 × Light Engineering Block",
  "quest.513011A503096C2F.title": "Obtain 1 × Light Engineering Block",
  "quest.513011A503096C2F.quest_desc": [
    "A Light Engineering Block is a multiblock construction part, not a finished workstation. Its SOQM recipe uses an Industrial Chassis and Electromechanical Drive alongside mechanical components.",
    "Choose your next structure in the Engineer’s Manual and count its materials first. This quest asks for the block in your inventory; placing a lone Light Engineering Block does not start production."
  ],
  "task.513012F4135F286D.title": "Obtain 1 × Heavy Engineering Block",
  "quest.513011C37B3FFEB2.title": "Obtain 1 × Heavy Engineering Block",
  "quest.513011C37B3FFEB2.quest_desc": [
    "Heavy Engineering Blocks are used in larger engineering structures and equipment. Their recipe depends on the Steel Mechanical Component, Industrial Chassis and Electromechanical Drive.",
    "Reserve the batch needed for your chosen multiblock before spending blocks on a drill or other equipment. This quest checks the construction block; a complete machine must be assembled and formed from its own diagram."
  ],
  "task.5130122EE8FC9DF9.title": "Obtain 1 × Redstone Engineering Block",
  "quest.513011F19F27E6F7.title": "Obtain 1 × Redstone Engineering Block",
  "quest.513011F19F27E6F7.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Redstone Engineering Block (immersiveengineering:rs_engineering). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012858A07383D.title": "Obtain 1 × Metal Press Mold: Plate",
  "quest.513011E25267FD65.title": "Obtain 1 × Metal Press Mold: Plate",
  "quest.513011E25267FD65.quest_desc": [
    "The plate mold selects the Metal Press’s plate-forming operation. It is piston tooling, not an ingredient to drop onto the conveyor.",
    "Make it using the appropriate engineering blueprint, then right-click the formed press to install it. Supply matching ingots and power. Switch to the corresponding mold when you need rods or gears instead."
  ],
  "task.513012F2BDD003D6.title": "Obtain 1 × Metal Press Mold: Gear",
  "quest.513011829B3BAD9A.title": "Obtain 1 × Metal Press Mold: Gear",
  "quest.513011829B3BAD9A.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Metal Press Mold: Gear (immersiveengineering:mold_gear). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130128215CAD56A.title": "Obtain 1 × Metal Press Mold: Rod",
  "quest.513011B5A6A9EB2A.title": "Obtain 1 × Metal Press Mold: Rod",
  "quest.513011B5A6A9EB2A.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Metal Press Mold: Rod (immersiveengineering:mold_rod). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130125547966805.title": "Obtain 1 × Metal Press Mold: Wire",
  "quest.513011E94A1C3709.title": "Obtain 1 × Metal Press Mold: Wire",
  "quest.513011E94A1C3709.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Metal Press Mold: Wire (immersiveengineering:mold_wire). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012D49B97CD5B.title": "Obtain 1 × Reinforced Blast Brick",
  "quest.5130112DAAA79EEE.title": "Obtain 1 × Reinforced Blast Brick",
  "quest.5130112DAAA79EEE.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Reinforced Blast Brick (immersiveengineering:blastbrick_reinforced). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012C60D8DFA3F.title": "Obtain 4 × Fluid Pipe",
  "quest.5130117254399ACB.title": "Obtain 4 × Fluid Pipe",
  "quest.5130117254399ACB.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 4 × Fluid Pipe (immersiveengineering:fluid_pipe). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012492344B2A2.title": "Obtain 1 × Blast Furnace Preheater",
  "quest.513011060A137580.title": "Obtain 1 × Blast Furnace Preheater",
  "quest.513011060A137580.quest_desc": [
    "A Blast Furnace Preheater accelerates the Improved Blast Furnace by supplying hot air. Place it at a designated side port; one furnace supports up to two preheaters.",
    "Supply power to each Preheater and compare the furnace under load. The preheater does not smelt steel by itself, replace coke, or add automation to the Crude Blast Furnace."
  ],
  "task.513012BCD3616DD8.title": "Obtain 1 × Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.5130113462B5267C.title": "Obtain 1 × Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.5130113462B5267C.quest_desc": [
    "A Conveyor Belt moves item entities without electrical power. Rotate it with the hammer and end the line at an inventory that can accept its cargo.",
    "An ordinary belt does not extract items from a chest by itself: feed it with a hopper, machine or Extracting Conveyor. A full destination leaves items backed up outside, so check storage capacity before a long run."
  ],
  "task.513012F3C0EF97C3.title": "Obtain 1 × Vertical Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.5130117F8A73721B.title": "Obtain 1 × Vertical Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.5130117F8A73721B.quest_desc": [
    "A Vertical Conveyor lifts items straight up where an inclined belt would take too much space. Feed its lower end and provide an inventory or onward belt at the top.",
    "Its buckets carry items, not fluids. Test the top transition with a small batch so cargo reaches the receiver instead of collecting above the lift shaft."
  ],
  "task.51301200F19AF17A.title": "Obtain 1 × Extracting Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.51301133BE177146.title": "Obtain 1 × Extracting Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.51301133BE177146.quest_desc": [
    "An Extracting Conveyor takes items from an adjacent inventory and sends them onto the belt. Place it beside the source chest; sneak-right-click with the hammer to change its input side.",
    "Adjust extraction speed with the screwdriver. Send a few items into an empty receiver before increasing the flow: faster extraction cannot solve a full output."
  ],
  "task.5130121F0114814F.title": "Obtain 1 × Splitting Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.5130110CAA0B1890.title": "Obtain 1 × Splitting Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.5130110CAA0B1890.quest_desc": [
    "A Splitting Conveyor alternates cargo between its left and right sides. It can distribute a stream across two receiving lines without electrical power.",
    "It redirects whole item entities rather than splitting each stack in half. A single stack of 64 therefore goes to one side; feed several separate portions when testing the alternation."
  ],
  "task.51301268D359BC14.title": "Obtain 1 × Redstone Controlled Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.513011A784AC24C0.title": "Obtain 1 × Redstone Controlled Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.513011A784AC24C0.quest_desc": [
    "A Redstone Controlled Conveyor lets you stop material on part of a belt. In this version it moves without a signal and stops when powered by redstone.",
    "Place it before the station whose input you want to control and test both states with a lever. Its signal polarity cannot be inverted with the screwdriver; it differs from multiblock redstone ports."
  ],
  "task.5130123395EFBF35.title": "Obtain 1 × Dropping Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.513011B10EB819FC.title": "Obtain 1 × Dropping Conveyor Belt",
  "quest.513011B10EB819FC.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Dropping Conveyor Belt (immersiveengineering:conveyor_dropper). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.51301270A7BDE82C.title": "Obtain 1 × Fluid Pump",
  "quest.513011E6BD90E95B.title": "Obtain 1 × Fluid Pump",
  "quest.513011E6BD90E95B.quest_desc": [
    "The Fluid Pump actively extracts fluid from a tank or suitable world source. Configure input, output and blocked faces on its lower half with the hammer, then connect the output to a tank.",
    "Its normal control requires a redstone signal; the screwdriver inverts that condition. Electrical power enables faster pumping. If creosote stays in a Coke Oven, check active extraction rather than just the presence of pipes."
  ],
  "task.513012FA959E745D.title": "Obtain 1 × Fluid Router",
  "quest.513011D01FAD3591.title": "Obtain 1 × Fluid Router",
  "quest.513011D01FAD3591.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Fluid Router (immersiveengineering:fluid_sorter). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
