  "chapter.513010C227ED8B09.title": "05 · Railways for the Factory",
  "chapter.513010C227ED8B09.chapter_subtitle": [
    "40 quests · English objective guide (alpha).",
    "Short lines: sequence · hover a quest: other prerequisites",
    "Open a quest to inspect all prerequisites. Its map role does not change its completion conditions."
  ],
  "task.5130129160C96678.title": "Multifunctional Rails",
  "quest.513011FDD667DD02.title": "Multifunctional Rails",
  "quest.513011FDD667DD02.quest_desc": [
    "Earn the native advancement Multifunctional Rails (railcraft:tracks/track_kit). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.51501234C2EC2FB0.title": "26 × Coke Oven Bricks — not consumed",
  "task.513012DD904815FD.title": "Coke Head",
  "quest.5130118DB31A46A1.title": "Coke Head",
  "quest.5130118DB31A46A1.quest_desc": [
    "Railcraft Coke Oven: 26 blocks, external dimensions 3×3×3. Leave the interior hollow; this is a different construction from its Immersive Engineering counterpart.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "Railcraft’s Coke Oven is a 3×3×3 cube with a hollow centre, requiring 26 Coke Oven Bricks. Use Railcraft’s own bricks and leave a gap between ovens; the task detects native formation of this structure.",
    "After construction, load coal and collect coke and creosote. Do not copy Immersive Engineering’s solid 27-block layout here: the two mods use different multiblocks."
  ],
  "task.515012F777D47651.title": "34 × Blast Furnace Bricks — not consumed",
  "task.51301250FF7786A4.title": "Steel Mill",
  "quest.5130110CBEF3D218.title": "Steel Mill",
  "quest.5130110CBEF3D218.quest_desc": [
    "Railcraft Blast Furnace: 34 blocks, external dimensions 3×4×3. Leave the interior hollow; this is a different construction from its Immersive Engineering counterpart.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one.",
    "Railcraft’s Blast Furnace is a 3×3×4 structure with an internal hollow, using 34 Blast Furnace Bricks. Follow the layers in Railcraft’s diagram and do not build another furnace directly against it.",
    "The quest detects formation. Then test a steel recipe with iron and a supported fuel in its interface; merely carrying bricks or building another mod’s furnace does not satisfy this native trigger."
  ],
  "task.513012240039DC2D.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Crowbar",
  "quest.5130114354CF7719.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Crowbar",
  "quest.5130114354CF7719.quest_desc": [
    "The Steel Crowbar is Railcraft’s main tool for tracks and carts. Right-clicking a supported track changes its direction or opens settings; on a locomotive it can reverse the facing.",
    "Use sneak-right-click on each of two carts to link them. Practise on a short test track: normal right-click and sneaking perform different actions."
  ],
  "task.5130123556581A20.title": "Obtain 1 × Manual Rolling Machine",
  "quest.513011E68E6D4690.title": "Obtain 1 × Manual Rolling Machine",
  "quest.513011E68E6D4690.quest_desc": [
    "The Manual Rolling Machine makes rails and other metal parts through its own recipes. Arrange the required materials in its grid and check the displayed result.",
    "If only enough material for one cycle remains, click the output display to force the craft. For continuous part production, progress to the Powered Rolling Machine with automated input."
  ],
  "task.513012406B3820BC.title": "Obtain 1 × Coke Oven Bricks",
  "quest.513011B3B6161380.title": "Obtain 1 × Coke Oven Bricks",
  "quest.513011B3B6161380.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Coke Oven Bricks (railcraft:coke_oven_bricks). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012307ED2B124.title": "Obtain 1 × Blast Furnace Bricks",
  "quest.513011C3CAE2637F.title": "Obtain 1 × Blast Furnace Bricks",
  "quest.513011C3CAE2637F.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Blast Furnace Bricks (railcraft:blast_furnace_bricks). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
