  "chapter.513010A2BB1D25A2.title": "14 · Extreme Reactors",
  "chapter.513010A2BB1D25A2.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Assemble fuel handling and control, connect your chosen FE output, then expand to a reinforced reactor and steam turbine. Active and passive ports are shown as alternatives.",
    "25 quests · 4 sequential production sections.",
    "Read top to bottom · hover a quest to see all its connections",
    "Open a quest to inspect all prerequisites, including links to other chapters. Item tasks check inventory; the description explains assembly and a test run."
  ],
  "task.513012EB7D8F6B10.title": "Obtain 1 × Extreme Wrench",
  "quest.513011F0C626AD17.title": "Obtain 1 × Extreme Wrench",
  "quest.513011F0C626AD17.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Extreme Wrench (bigreactors:wrench). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130128F1054DBE1.title": "Obtain 1 × Graphite Bar",
  "quest.513011BFCD6008D7.title": "Graphite: the reactor material",
  "quest.513011BFCD6008D7.quest_desc": [
    "Prepare Graphite for reactor components. The central branch goes through casing, fuel elements and control to a complete parts kit. Yellorium on the side is one fuel material; inspect the available uranium alternatives in JEI."
  ],
  "task.5130125E5A0EEB51.title": "Obtain 1 × Yellorium Ingot",
  "quest.5130110704EB117A.title": "Obtain 1 × Yellorium Ingot",
  "quest.5130110704EB117A.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Yellorium Ingot (bigreactors:yellorium_ingot). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130120A6F892972.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Casing (Basic)",
  "quest.5130114528E50D7E.title": "Basic Reactor: start with the shell",
  "quest.5130114528E50D7E.quest_desc": [
    "Build the Basic Reactor shell from compatible blocks, reserving positions for its controller, fuel access and required outputs. The item count is not a building blueprint; check the native Extreme Reactors guide for size and assembly requirements."
  ],
  "task.513012F83E09B99E.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Fuel Rod (Basic)",
  "quest.513011862E2A45CA.title": "Fuel columns inside the casing",
  "quest.513011862E2A45CA.quest_desc": [
    "Fuel Rods form the internal fuel columns. Arrange them according to the reactor design and prepare a Control Rod for each required column. JEI shows the recipe's supported material alternatives."
  ],
  "task.513012676AF27FE2.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Control Rod (Basic)",
  "quest.5130118ED1242B42.title": "Control the fuel columns",
  "quest.5130118ED1242B42.quest_desc": [
    "A Control Rod controls its fuel column. Before startup, check that the components form a valid structure, reactor controls are available, and the fuel port has supply and extraction paths."
  ],
  "task.513012F336ED61DC.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Solid Access Port (Basic)",
  "quest.51301145D1657839.title": "Fuel input and waste output",
  "quest.51301145D1657839.quest_desc": [
    "The Solid Access Port connects fuel storage and solid waste extraction. Configure its modes and separate inventories so waste does not block later fuel batches."
  ],
  "task.5130120FC14B809F.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Active Forge Energy Power Tap (Basic)",
  "quest.5130114F4058570C.title": "Active FE output: one option",
  "quest.5130114F4058570C.quest_desc": [
    "This Power Tap is one option for connecting the energy output. Choose active or passive behavior for your network; the first working installation does not require both side branches."
  ],
  "task.51301225761E39D0.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Passive Forge Energy Power Tap (Basic)",
  "quest.51301145F95C79CF.title": "Passive FE output: another option",
  "quest.51301145F95C79CF.quest_desc": [
    "The passive Power Tap offers another connection to the energy network. Check the adjacent cable or consumer and confirm energy leaves the reactor."
  ],
  "task.513012EB5434F4AA.title": "1 × Reactor Controller (Basic) — not consumed",
  "task.515012C4ADFE4953.title": "22 × Reactor Casing (Basic) — not consumed",
  "task.515012253AB5F9C7.title": "1 × Reactor Fuel Rod (Basic) — not consumed",
  "task.515012400004D266.title": "1 × Reactor Control Rod (Basic) — not consumed",
  "task.51501217872F1735.title": "1 × Reactor Solid Access Port (Basic) — not consumed",
  "task.515012F628EC62D5.title": "1 × Reactor Active Forge Energy Power Tap (Basic) — not consumed",
  "quest.513011AB19DDDE4C.title": "Basic Reactor: 3×3×3 Kit",
  "quest.513011AB19DDDE4C.quest_desc": [
    "Minimum 3×3×3 reactor: 22 Casings, a Controller, Fuel Rod, Control Rod, Solid Access Port and Active FE Power Tap. Put the Fuel Rod in the only interior block and the Control Rod in the roof above it.",
    "This layout produces FE directly. Load fuel through the Access Port and switch that same port to extract waste when needed. Glass can optionally replace casing on the faces.",
    "Open the controller after assembly to check formation. These inventory tasks alone do not verify a valid or operating reactor.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one."
  ],
  "task.513012E4850A7756.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Casing (Reinforced)",
  "quest.5130116F060F9DEC.title": "Reinforced Reactor: the next structure",
  "quest.5130116F060F9DEC.quest_desc": [
    "After the basic reactor, this branch teaches the reinforced structure and preparation for a steam cycle. Casing recipes can include direct crafting and upgrades; choose an available JEI recipe and keep each structure's blocks compatible."
  ],
  "task.513012601A827B5A.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Fuel Rod (Reinforced)",
  "quest.51301107E386EFB8.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Fuel Rod (Reinforced)",
  "quest.51301107E386EFB8.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Reactor Fuel Rod (Reinforced) (bigreactors:reinforced_reactorfuelrod). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.51301232A6FF292B.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Control Rod (Reinforced)",
  "quest.513011FE729B76A7.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Control Rod (Reinforced)",
  "quest.513011FE729B76A7.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Reactor Control Rod (Reinforced) (bigreactors:reinforced_reactorcontrolrod). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130124A4D200CD5.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Active Forge Fluid Port (Reinforced)",
  "quest.5130119494D319D8.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Active Forge Fluid Port (Reinforced)",
  "quest.5130119494D319D8.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Reactor Active Forge Fluid Port (Reinforced) (bigreactors:reinforced_reactorfluidport_forge_active). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130128DBA7C7DAA.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Passive Forge Fluid Port (Reinforced)",
  "quest.513011E66B511C8A.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Passive Forge Fluid Port (Reinforced)",
  "quest.513011E66B511C8A.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Reactor Passive Forge Fluid Port (Reinforced) (bigreactors:reinforced_reactorfluidport_forge_passive). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012669070C58D.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Solid Access Port (Reinforced)",
  "quest.51301107B8137F21.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Solid Access Port (Reinforced)",
  "quest.51301107B8137F21.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Reactor Solid Access Port (Reinforced) (bigreactors:reinforced_reactorsolidaccessport). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130127DD81854F0.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Active Forge Energy Power Tap (Reinforced)",
  "quest.5130110C4EA8DEFA.title": "Obtain 1 × Reactor Active Forge Energy Power Tap (Reinforced)",
  "quest.5130110C4EA8DEFA.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Reactor Active Forge Energy Power Tap (Reinforced) (bigreactors:reinforced_reactorpowertapfe_active). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130129CB4CCDB25.title": "Obtain 1 × Turbine Housing (Reinforced)",
  "quest.51301193487DECA3.title": "A turbine for the steam cycle",
  "quest.51301193487DECA3.quest_desc": [
    "The Turbine Casing uses Cyanite from the reactor route and forms a separate steam-powered structure. Its recipe does not require a Reinforced Reactor: prepare a compatible steam source, rotor, bearing and induction coils using the native guide. Item quests do not enumerate every block for every possible size."
  ],
  "task.5130128B78D56FBD.title": "1 × Turbine Controller (Reinforced) — not consumed",
  "task.5150128C9615553E.title": "39 × Turbine Housing (Reinforced) — not consumed",
  "task.5150129B0B6BA27B.title": "1 × Turbine Rotor Bearing (Reinforced) — not consumed",
  "task.515012150EDB31C1.title": "2 × Turbine Active Forge Fluid Port (Reinforced) — not consumed",
  "task.51501254E9076178.title": "1 × Turbine Active Forge Energy Power Tap (Reinforced) — not consumed",
  "task.5150122231D8ABE7.title": "2 × Turbine Rotor Shaft (Reinforced) — not consumed",
  "task.5150123151CA3AC5.title": "1 × Turbine Rotor Blade (Reinforced) — not consumed",
  "task.5150127AE9328889.title": "1 × Block of Iron — not consumed",
  "quest.51301182A048FC8B.title": "Extreme Reactors Turbine: Complete Kit",
  "quest.51301182A048FC8B.quest_desc": [
    "The smallest reviewed layout with separate blade and coil layers is an asymmetric 3×4×4 shell (X×Y×Z). Its 44 shell blocks are 39 Casings, a Controller, a Rotor Bearing, two Fluid Ports and an FE Power Tap.",
    "From the lower corner (0,0,0), place the Bearing at (1,3,1) facing down. Put Shafts at (1,2,1) and (1,1,1), one Blade at (1,2,2), and the iron-block coil at (1,1,2). Keep a Casing at (1,0,1). The blade and coil occupy separate levels along the shaft.",
    "Put the controller and ports on other faces without replacing frame edges. One Fluid Port accepts steam; the other returns water. Engage the coil in the controller and supply a small steam flow. This compact rig introduces generation; expand it for industrial throughput.",
    "The quest verifies the full kit. Check formation and an increasing FE counter in the controller after assembly.",
    "The tasks check each material and quantity without consuming it. Hold the kit before placing it, then complete the separate formation or operation check where this quest has one."
  ],
  "task.513012A46E88916C.title": "Obtain 1 × Turbine Rotor Shaft (Reinforced)",
  "quest.5130117DD8F75308.title": "Shaft before blades",
  "quest.5130117DD8F75308.quest_desc": [
    "The Rotor Shaft defines the turbine axis. Arrange shaft, blades and bearing as one valid assembly and place induction coils according to the guide. The controller then completes the kit."
  ],
  "task.513012BD52952E61.title": "Obtain 1 × Turbine Rotor Blade (Reinforced)",
  "quest.5130112AA6480CE8.title": "Obtain 1 × Turbine Rotor Blade (Reinforced)",
  "quest.5130112AA6480CE8.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Turbine Rotor Blade (Reinforced) (bigreactors:reinforced_turbinerotorblade). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012CC33D55381.title": "Obtain 1 × Turbine Rotor Bearing (Reinforced)",
  "quest.513011EA1BEE4329.title": "Obtain 1 × Turbine Rotor Bearing (Reinforced)",
  "quest.513011EA1BEE4329.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Turbine Rotor Bearing (Reinforced) (bigreactors:reinforced_turbinerotorbearing). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012C6B1664021.title": "Obtain 1 × Turbine Active Forge Fluid Port (Reinforced)",
  "quest.5130116A01924E20.title": "Obtain 1 × Turbine Active Forge Fluid Port (Reinforced)",
