  "quest.513011FE8D522CBB.quest_desc": [
    "Minimum 3×3×3 reactor: 22 Casings, a Controller, Fuel Rod, Control Rod, Solid Access Port and Active FE Power Tap. Put the Fuel Rod in the only interior block and the Control Rod in the roof above it.",
    "This layout produces FE directly. Load fuel through the Access Port and switch that same port to extract waste when needed. Glass can optionally replace casing on the faces.",
