  "task.5130122EA31FB061.title": "Obtain 1 × Eden Chunk",
  "quest.51301162D2C3B8F7.title": "Obtain 1 × Eden Chunk",
  "quest.51301162D2C3B8F7.quest_desc": [
    "The Eden material line has two crafting steps: three Eden Fragments in a row make one Eden Gem, and three Eden Gems in a row make one Eden Chunk. One chunk therefore requires nine fragments through this route.",
    "A batch of four Stellar Alloys needs two Eden Chunks. Prepare six gems, or eighteen fragments before conversion. Gems and chunks are distinct items; the alloy recipe requires chunks."
  ],
