  "task.513012045E973BE6.title": "Obtain 1 × Mortum Chunk",
  "quest.513011A46F929BA0.title": "Obtain 1 × Mortum Chunk",
  "quest.513011A46F929BA0.quest_desc": [
    "Mortum Ore yields Mortum Fragments when mined normally; Silk Touch collects the ore block instead. Three fragments in a row make one Mortum Gem, and three gems in a row make one Mortum Chunk.",
    "A batch of two Mythic Circuits requires four Mortum Chunks. Through the fragment route, that means twelve gems or thirty-six fragments. Also reserve two Gaia Ingots, Ultimate Control Circuits and Stellar Alloy for the rest of the recipe."
  ],
