  "task.513012F77F10D51C.title": "Obtain 1 × Magic Map Focus",
  "quest.51301123DAC0957F.title": "Obtain 1 × Magic Map Focus",
  "quest.51301123DAC0957F.quest_desc": [
    "Combine a Raven Feather, Torchberries and Glowstone Dust in any crafting-grid arrangement to make a Magic Map Focus. The recipe requires the Twilight Forest raven’s feather; an ordinary Feather will not work.",
    "The focus is the center ingredient of the Blank Magic Map recipe. Prepare eight Paper for the next step so you can use the finished map to locate Twilight Forest structures."
  ],
  "task.5130121BC81157E9.title": "Obtain 1 × Blank Magic Map",
  "quest.513011928D69B5C9.title": "Obtain 1 × Blank Magic Map",
  "quest.513011928D69B5C9.quest_desc": [
    "Surround a Magic Map Focus with eight Paper to craft a Blank Magic Map. Use it in the Twilight Forest to create a filled Magic Map that helps locate structures.",
    "This quest asks for the Blank Magic Map, twilightforest:magic_map. Let the task detect it before activation, because the filled map has a different item ID."
  ],
