  "task.513012B074E8F337.title": "Obtain 1 × Fiery Ingot",
  "quest.51301100FCAB4EA0.title": "Obtain 1 × Fiery Ingot",
  "quest.51301100FCAB4EA0.quest_desc": [
    "Craft a Fiery Ingot without smelting: combine one Iron Ingot with one Fiery Blood or Fiery Tears in a crafting grid. The Hydra drops Fiery Blood, while the Ur-Ghast drops Fiery Tears; the recipe accepts either material.",
    "Reserve two ingots for a batch of two Dimensional Matrices. This is Twilight Forest’s contribution to the first rocket engine and later SOQM machines; budget separately for personal Fiery equipment."
  ],
