  "chapter.513010C83F2E95C7.title": "21 · Ad Astra: Beyond the Atmosphere",
  "chapter.513010C83F2E95C7.chapter_subtitle": [
    "65 quests · English objective guide (alpha).",
    "Short lines: sequence · hover a quest: other prerequisites",
    "Open a quest to inspect all prerequisites. Its map role does not change its completion conditions."
  ],
  "task.513012CA9AFA5712.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Rod",
  "quest.513011CAEFCC265B.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Rod",
  "quest.513011CAEFCC265B.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Steel Rod (ad_astra:steel_rod). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012FB66218447.title": "Obtain 1 × Engine Frame",
  "quest.513011B6548D0312.title": "Obtain 1 × Engine Frame",
  "quest.513011B6548D0312.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Engine Frame (ad_astra:engine_frame). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.51301264A02B25A8.title": "Obtain 1 × Fan",
  "quest.5130110A4743ECB0.title": "Obtain 1 × Fan",
  "quest.5130110A4743ECB0.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Fan (ad_astra:fan). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130125B639BCB9F.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Engine",
  "quest.5130119A494692FD.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Engine",
  "quest.5130119A494692FD.quest_desc": [
    "In SOQM, the Steel Engine needs a Dimensional Matrix, five Steel Plates, an Engine Frame and a Fan. The matrix ties the first rocket engine to the earlier magic and dimensional progression.",
    "The finished engine is a rocket component, not a supply of rocket fuel. The next Desh Engine also consumes a Steel Engine as an ingredient, so account for that in your production plan."
  ],
  "task.513012E9973C25F9.title": "Obtain 1 × Tier 1 Rocket",
  "quest.513011ABD424EA8F.title": "Tier 1 Rocket: Prepare to Launch",
  "quest.513011ABD424EA8F.quest_desc": [
    "Craft the rocket in a NASA Workbench, build a Launch Pad and place the rocket in its center. Shift-right-click opens its fuel and cargo inventory.",
    "Before launching, prepare a full oxygen-filled space set, spare oxygen, food, tools, airless-safe lighting and the fuel and launch pad for your return.",
    "Enter the fueled rocket and press the jump key. After landing, recover the rocket and cargo from the lander instead of leaving your return equipment inside."
  ],
  "task.513012591C599842.title": "Obtain 1 × Wrench",
  "quest.51301123D24102F2.title": "Obtain 1 × Wrench",
  "quest.51301123D24102F2.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Wrench (ad_astra:wrench). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012BD7D0CE31D.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Ingot",
  "quest.51301101FA8B13AD.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Ingot",
  "quest.51301101FA8B13AD.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Steel Ingot (ad_astra:steel_ingot). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012B0F88648CF.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Plate",
  "quest.51301154264E3947.title": "Obtain 1 × Steel Plate",
  "quest.51301154264E3947.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Steel Plate (ad_astra:steel_plate). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012DCAEF587EB.title": "Obtain 1 × Iron Plate",
  "quest.513011CEB2DA43F7.title": "Obtain 1 × Iron Plate",
  "quest.513011CEB2DA43F7.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Iron Plate (ad_astra:iron_plate). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130120BC66BFC4E.title": "Obtain 1 × Oxygen Gear",
  "quest.513011D056923FAA.title": "Obtain 1 × Oxygen Gear",
  "quest.513011D056923FAA.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Oxygen Gear (ad_astra:oxygen_gear). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130127BBE505172.title": "Obtain 1 × Gas Tank",
  "quest.51301102879BA857.title": "Obtain 1 × Gas Tank",
  "quest.51301102879BA857.quest_desc": [
    "Fill a Gas Tank with oxygen in an Oxygen Loader and inspect its contents before launch. An empty tank occupies the same inventory slot but provides no reserve for your suit.",
    "Use the filled tank to distribute its contents into compatible items in your inventory. Keep the reserve accessible during the expedition and monitor the suit’s actual oxygen supply."
  ],
  "task.5130122545D4353E.title": "Obtain 1 × Oxygen Loader",
  "quest.5130112D843FED07.title": "Oxygen Loader: Fill before Flight",
  "quest.5130112D843FED07.quest_desc": [
    "Power the Oxygen Loader, supply water to its water tank and wait for oxygen to accumulate. The machine converts water into oxygen.",
    "Use its container slot to fill the Space Suit and spare Gas Tanks. Inspect the oxygen amount on the finished equipment before disconnecting and launching.",
    "This is ground preparation for the first Moon trip. An Oxygen Distributor creates a habitable area at a base and serves a different purpose."
  ],
  "task.51301202929C722D.title": "Obtain 1 × Oxygen Sensor",
  "quest.513011BEB9C533E8.title": "Obtain 1 × Oxygen Sensor",
  "quest.513011BEB9C533E8.quest_desc": [
    "The Oxygen Sensor emits a redstone signal when it detects oxygen at its location. Use it to indicate the state of a room served by an Oxygen Distributor; the sensor itself does not produce breathable air.",
    "Interacting while sneaking inverts the signal. Check which state means an alarm in your circuit, and place the sensor in the occupied area rather than checking only beside the machine."
  ],
  "task.513012952B4C9EA3.title": "Obtain 1 × Compressor",
  "quest.51301100AAEE96B5.title": "Obtain 1 × Compressor",
  "quest.51301100AAEE96B5.quest_desc": [
    "The Compressor turns metal ingots into plates through compressing recipes and consumes FE. Its SOQM crafting recipe requires an Industrial Chassis, two Pistons and six Iron Ingots.",
    "Connect power, insert an ingot and leave the output slot clear. You will use this machine again after reaching the Moon: one Desh Ingot produces one Desh Plate for space components and Stellar Alloy."
  ],
  "task.513012FB3A542D4A.title": "Obtain 1 × Nasa Workbench",
  "quest.51301125F300B5D5.title": "Obtain 1 × Nasa Workbench",
  "quest.51301125F300B5D5.quest_desc": [
    "The NASA Workbench performs the final assembly of rockets. Prepare the nose cone, body blocks, tanks, fins and engine for the desired tier separately; a normal 3×3 crafting grid cannot assemble these recipes.",
    "The station’s SOQM recipe requires a Dimensional Matrix, a Control Assembly and a Precision Mechanism alongside steel and other components. An assembled rocket still needs a Launch Pad and fuel before launch."
  ],
  "task.513012DC434EA9B3.title": "One Small Step",
  "quest.5130113E390D02AA.title": "First Landing: Desh and a Return Route",
  "quest.5130113E390D02AA.quest_desc": [
    "On the Moon, watch your oxygen and keep the return kit intact. Ordinary torches and water behave differently from Earth; use suitable lighting.",
    "Mine Desh underground. Return with enough for processing and plates, which contribute to Stellar Alloy and radiation shielding.",
    "For the return flight, recover equipment from the lander, place the Launch Pad and rocket and refuel it. A lunar base with an Oxygen Distributor is a separate next project."
  ],
  "task.5130125B7871CC9A.title": "Obtain 1 × Desh Plate",
  "quest.513011D45DD1A1E7.title": "Obtain 1 × Desh Plate",
  "quest.513011D45DD1A1E7.quest_desc": [
    "In a powered Compressor, one Desh Ingot becomes one Desh Plate; compressing a full Desh Block produces nine plates. Smelt lunar raw material into ingots first, then start plate production.",
    "Reserve four plates for a batch of four Stellar Alloys. Engines, base equipment and Radiation Shields also need plates, so distribute your lunar stock across those planned components."
  ],
  "task.51301257CE73B49E.title": "Obtain 1 × Desh Engine",
  "quest.5130112238B982DA.title": "Obtain 1 × Desh Engine",
  "quest.5130112238B982DA.quest_desc": [
    "The SOQM Desh Engine consumes a Steel Engine and adds Desh Plates, a Fan, Stellar Alloy, a Quantum Processor and a Dimensional Matrix. Lunar ore unlocks its metal, while assembly also relies on your cross-mod production line.",
    "After the engine, prepare the remaining Tier 2 Rocket components for the NASA Workbench. The engine alone is not a complete rocket and does not carry over fuel from a previous craft."
  ],
  "task.513012EF7878EB0D.title": "Obtain 1 × Desh Tank",
  "quest.51301102AE9BB373.title": "Obtain 1 × Desh Tank",
  "quest.51301102AE9BB373.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Desh Tank (ad_astra:desh_tank). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012E2837C6AA9.title": "Obtain 1 × Tier 2 Rocket",
  "quest.51301179BA55079F.title": "Obtain 1 × Tier 2 Rocket",
  "quest.51301179BA55079F.quest_desc": [
    "Assemble the Tier 2 Rocket in the NASA Workbench using six Desh Blocks, two Desh Tanks, four Rocket Fins, a Desh Engine and a Rocket Nose Cone. The six body blocks require metal in addition to the plates used by the engine and tanks.",
    "The tier-two rocket enables travel to Mars. Transfer your equipment, oxygen and return kit before launch, then check the new rocket’s own fuel supply."
  ],
  "task.513012F6911E0F44.title": "The Martian",
  "quest.51301138CDC4FC6E.title": "The Martian",
  "quest.51301138CDC4FC6E.quest_desc": [
    "Travel to Mars requires at least a tier-two rocket. The next resource target is Ostrum, used for the Netherite Space Suit, more advanced machines and the tier-three rocket.",
    "The task checks actually entering the Mars dimension. Assembling a rocket or viewing the planet in the travel menu does not complete it; keep your return equipment and fuel after landing."
  ],
  "task.51301241183584C1.title": "Obtain 1 × Ostrum Engine",
  "quest.51301152E78DE39E.title": "Obtain 1 × Ostrum Engine",
  "quest.51301152E78DE39E.quest_desc": [
    "The Ostrum Engine consumes a Desh Engine. It also requires Ostrum Plates, a Fan, Stellar Alloy, a Quantum Processor and a Dimensional Matrix, so the new ore does not replace the earlier engine stage.",
    "Budget Ostrum separately for the engine, tanks and six body blocks of the Tier 3 Rocket. Also reserve enough for a complete protective space suit before visiting hot planets."
  ],
  "task.51301228664FE6F3.title": "Obtain 1 × Ostrum Tank",
  "quest.513011AC257CA77E.title": "Obtain 1 × Ostrum Tank",
  "quest.513011AC257CA77E.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Ostrum Tank (ad_astra:ostrum_tank). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012A88893DDA4.title": "Obtain 1 × Tier 3 Rocket",
  "quest.513011F70694CD2B.title": "Obtain 1 × Tier 3 Rocket",
  "quest.513011F70694CD2B.quest_desc": [
    "Combine six Ostrum Blocks, two Ostrum Tanks, four Rocket Fins, an Ostrum Engine and a Rocket Nose Cone in the NASA Workbench. These components assemble the complete Tier 3 Rocket.",
    "Tier three enables travel to Venus and Mercury. Prepare a full oxygen-filled Netherite Space Suit before selecting those destinations; reaching a planet does not make a standard suit suitable for its heat."
  ],
  "task.51301219A3056474.title": "Obtain 1 × Calorite Tank",
  "quest.513011AA7F850AD0.title": "Obtain 1 × Calorite Tank",
  "quest.513011AA7F850AD0.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Calorite Tank (ad_astra:calorite_tank). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012AD5A7BEFBA.title": "Obtain 1 × Tier 4 Rocket",
  "quest.5130111C890D830A.title": "Obtain 1 × Tier 4 Rocket",
  "quest.5130111C890D830A.quest_desc": [
    "Assemble the Tier 4 Rocket in the NASA Workbench from six Calorite Blocks, two Calorite Tanks, four Rocket Fins, a Calorite Engine and a Rocket Nose Cone. The earlier engine chain is included in the cost of its new engine.",
    "This tier opens travel to a new solar system. The Interstellar quest requires entering Glacio; merely obtaining the rocket is covered by its separate item task."
  ],
  "task.513012C5C965528D.title": "Obtain 1 × Space Helmet",
  "task.513012B05F5EE691.title": "Obtain 1 × Space Pants",
  "task.51301289E4FAEE0A.title": "Obtain 1 × Space Boots",
  "quest.5130114FE09DA6CE.title": "Complete Space Equipment",
  "quest.5130114FE09DA6CE.quest_desc": [
    "Prepare the Space Helmet, Space Pants and Space Boots before the first landing. Equip them together with the oxygen-filled Space Suit chest piece.",
    "Check all four armor slots before departure. Strong armor from another mod does not automatically provide Ad Astra’s environmental protection."
  ],
  "task.513012C38001BEFC.title": "Obtain 1 × Space Suit",
  "quest.5130115956283BA9.title": "Fill the Suit before the First Moon Trip",
  "quest.5130115956283BA9.quest_desc": [
    "Craft the Space Suit and fill it with oxygen in an Oxygen Loader. Equip the complete ordinary space set: the chest piece supplies oxygen but does not replace the other equipment.",
    "Check actual oxygen reserves and carry filled Gas Tanks. This set protects in cold airless environments; hot planets need the next protection tier.",
    "The item task accepts the suit regardless of its fill level. Check oxygen before launch yourself: the completion mark does not measure the reserve."
  ],
  "task.513012649444713C.title": "Obtain 1 × Oxygen Distributor",
  "quest.513011635A57E77B.title": "Obtain 1 × Oxygen Distributor",
  "quest.513011635A57E77B.quest_desc": [
    "The Oxygen Distributor converts water into oxygen for a sealed room and needs continuous FE. Supply water to its tank; for ongoing water supply, place a Water Pump over an infinite water source next to the distributor and power both machines.",
    "Seal the room and press Show in the distributor GUI: the highlighted volume shows where oxygen actually reaches. Resolve leak warnings; internal doors and walls may require Vents between rooms.",
    "Check the occupied area before removing your suit. The quest detects the Oxygen Distributor item; placement, water supply, power and a sealed enclosure must be arranged separately."
  ],
  "task.513012ADDD113E7B.title": "Obtain 1 × Oxygen Bucket",
  "quest.513011984F5B40C8.title": "Oxygen as an Expedition Supply",
  "quest.513011984F5B40C8.quest_desc": [
    "Fill an oxygen bucket from the Oxygen Loader after it processes water. This checks ground-based oxygen production before the first flight.",
    "For a longer trip, fill the suit and Gas Tanks and inspect their capacities. Owning one bucket does not prove you have enough oxygen for the expedition."
  ],
  "task.513012EE48CF2E35.title": "Obtain 1 × Fuel Bucket",
  "quest.513011A99D6EA3A8.title": "Fuel for Departure and Return",
  "quest.513011A99D6EA3A8.quest_desc": [
    "Process oil into Fuel in a powered Fuel Refinery. The rocket uses refined fuel; a bucket of crude oil is not a substitute.",
    "Shift-right-click the placed rocket and fill its tank according to the gauge. Pack fuel for a return launch and a launch pad separately in its cargo.",
    "Prepare the return trip on Earth. The quest checks an item, not all of the rocket’s supplies."
  ],
  "task.51301253902FB14D.title": "Obtain 1 × Desh Ingot",
  "quest.513011FE61D9DE0F.title": "Obtain 1 × Desh Ingot",
  "quest.513011FE61D9DE0F.quest_desc": [
    "Desh is the first metal in lunar progression. Mine Raw Desh on the Moon and smelt it in a furnace or blast furnace to obtain Desh Ingots.",
    "Divide your stock between body blocks for the Tier 2 Rocket and ingots for the Compressor. Desh Plates also feed Stellar Alloy, connecting your lunar expedition to the wider SOQM campaign."
  ],
  "task.51301246F2B8CD33.title": "Obtain 4 × Desh Cable",
  "quest.513011028FE78243.title": "Obtain 4 × Desh Cable",
  "quest.513011028FE78243.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 4 × Desh Cable (ad_astra:desh_cable). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130129BE3FCE127.title": "Obtain 4 × Desh Fluid Pipe",
  "quest.513011AC5E9A34D4.title": "Obtain 4 × Desh Fluid Pipe",
  "quest.513011AC5E9A34D4.quest_desc": [
    "Configure Desh Fluid Pipe endpoints with the Ad Astra wrench. Extract at the source pumps fluid into the network, while Insert at the receiving machine delivers it; simply connecting pipes does not establish an extraction endpoint.",
    "Use the corresponding Fluid Pipe Duct when passing through the wall of a sealed base. After installation, check both the receiving tank and the room’s seal using the Oxygen Distributor."
  ],
  "task.513012F1A7285011.title": "Obtain 1 × Solar Panel",
  "quest.5130116AA9FFE833.title": "Obtain 1 × Solar Panel",
  "quest.5130116AA9FFE833.quest_desc": [
    "The Solar Panel generates FE, with output depending on the world, distance from the star and atmosphere. Read its actual generation in the GUI after placement instead of assuming the output of another planet.",
    "Its SOQM recipe requires Desh Plates, Photovoltaic Etrium Cells, Steel Plates, a Control Assembly and a Precision Mechanism. For base life support, compare generation with the Oxygen Distributor and water pump demand and provide energy storage."
  ],
  "task.5130123882F1F693.title": "Obtain 1 × Ostrum Ingot",
  "quest.513011FBDEB88C4F.title": "Obtain 1 × Ostrum Ingot",
  "quest.513011FBDEB88C4F.quest_desc": [
    "Look for Ostrum on Mars. Smelt Raw Ostrum in a furnace or blast furnace, then send some of the resulting ingots to the Compressor for plates.",
    "Budget for two routes at once: the Tier 3 Rocket and the Netherite Space Suit needed on hot planets. Reserve the suit materials before committing your stock to the rocket’s six body blocks."
  ],
  "task.513012FFF8D6A1C0.title": "Obtain 1 × Ostrum Plate",
  "quest.5130111A30152678.title": "Obtain 1 × Ostrum Plate",
  "quest.5130111A30152678.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Ostrum Plate (ad_astra:ostrum_plate). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012A54C1CB404.title": "Obtain 4 × Ostrum Fluid Pipe",
  "quest.51301107EA34F802.title": "Obtain 4 × Ostrum Fluid Pipe",
  "quest.51301107EA34F802.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 4 × Ostrum Fluid Pipe (ad_astra:ostrum_fluid_pipe). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012B7C8D936CE.title": "Obtain 1 × Calorite Ingot",
  "quest.5130117C7AD68848.title": "Obtain 1 × Calorite Ingot",
  "quest.5130117C7AD68848.quest_desc": [
    "Calorite is the next target after unlocking the hot planets Venus and Mercury. Prepare heat protection and oxygen, collect Raw Calorite and smelt it into ingots.",
    "The Tier 4 Rocket requires six Calorite Blocks plus the materials for its tanks and engine. The SOQM engine recipe also depends on a Mythic Circuit and Radiation Shield, so the new metal is only part of interstellar preparation."
  ],
  "task.513012391B7869E2.title": "Obtain 1 × Calorite Plate",
  "quest.513011956693E047.title": "Obtain 1 × Calorite Plate",
  "quest.513011956693E047.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Calorite Plate (ad_astra:calorite_plate). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130120C8EAFA4EF.title": "Obtain 1 × Etrium Ingot",
  "quest.51301148648A5155.title": "Obtain 1 × Etrium Ingot",
  "quest.51301148648A5155.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Etrium Ingot (ad_astra:etrium_ingot). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012C45656AFDD.title": "Venusian",
  "quest.513011B86476F5E1.title": "Venusian",
  "quest.513011B86476F5E1.quest_desc": [
    "Earn the native advancement Venusian (ad_astra:venus). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.513012FB871929E6.title": "Quite the Sun Tan",
  "quest.513011CDEACD7F3A.title": "Quite the Sun Tan",
  "quest.513011CDEACD7F3A.quest_desc": [
    "Earn the native advancement Quite the Sun Tan (ad_astra:mercury). Follow its requirement in the Advancements screen or the mod's guide."
  ],
  "task.513012E280734247.title": "Interstellar",
  "quest.5130112935FFF4C2.title": "Interstellar",
  "quest.5130112935FFF4C2.quest_desc": [
    "In this Ad Astra version, Interstellar requires actually entering Glacio. Prepare a Tier 4 Rocket, fuel, oxygen and a return kit, then select the planet in the new system.",
    "Orbiting a planet or merely crafting the Tier 4 Rocket does not meet this condition. After landing, retain the landing equipment and check supplies before exploring farther."
  ],
  "task.5130124EC35F2447.title": "Unconventional Flight",
  "quest.51301162F20C9431.title": "Zip Gun: A Controlled Boost",
  "quest.51301162F20C9431.quest_desc": [
    "Hold the Zip Gun and use it to propel yourself. The native condition checks using the item, not merely owning it.",
    "Test in an open safe area first. It assists movement in zero gravity; watch your direction and keep a way back to stable ground."
  ],
  "task.51301296977059FB.title": "Obtain 1 × Calorite Engine",
  "quest.51301144D2BF0879.title": "Obtain 1 × Calorite Engine",
  "quest.51301144D2BF0879.quest_desc": [
    "The SOQM Calorite Engine consumes an Ostrum Engine, four Calorite Plates, a Fan, a Quantum Processor, a Mythic Circuit and a Radiation Shield. Finishing this component requires the mythic and radiation-related production lines.",
    "Reserve the engine for the Tier 4 Rocket and prepare additional Calorite for its body and tanks. Keep enough metal for the rocket’s body blocks instead of turning the whole stock into plates."
  ],
  "task.513012DF2349D4F0.title": "Obtain 1 × Netherite Space Helmet",
  "task.5130123CB5B47779.title": "Obtain 1 × Netherite Space Pants",
  "task.5130123734945CEB.title": "Obtain 1 × Netherite Space Boots",
  "quest.5130111D0840212E.title": "Obtain 1 × Netherite Space Helmet + Obtain 1 × Netherite Space Pants + More",
  "quest.5130111D0840212E.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Netherite Space Helmet (ad_astra:netherite_space_helmet). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Netherite Space Pants (ad_astra:netherite_space_pants). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Netherite Space Boots (ad_astra:netherite_space_boots). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012082A03ED72.title": "Obtain 1 × Netherite Space Suit",
  "quest.513011C599FF7F42.title": "Obtain 1 × Netherite Space Suit",
  "quest.513011C599FF7F42.quest_desc": [
    "The Netherite Space Suit is the chest piece of the set used on hot planets. Also prepare the Netherite Space Helmet, Pants and Boots before visiting Venus or Mercury; equip the complete protective set.",
    "The upgrade provides heat protection but does not remove the need for oxygen. Fill the suit in an Oxygen Loader and check your spare Gas Tanks before departure."
  ],
  "task.5130127A8AF84C90.title": "Obtain 1 × Jet Suit Helmet",
  "task.513012B8D3C1DD5F.title": "Obtain 1 × Jet Suit Pants",
  "task.5130121F31420333.title": "Obtain 1 × Jet Suit Boots",
  "quest.5130111066461318.title": "Obtain 1 × Jet Suit Helmet + Obtain 1 × Jet Suit Pants + More",
  "quest.5130111066461318.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Jet Suit Helmet (ad_astra:jet_suit_helmet). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Jet Suit Pants (ad_astra:jet_suit_pants). The items are not consumed by this task.",
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Jet Suit Boots (ad_astra:jet_suit_boots). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130127FA7982E0E.title": "Obtain 1 × Jet Suit",
  "quest.513011D1CD69347F.title": "Obtain 1 × Jet Suit",
  "quest.513011D1CD69347F.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Jet Suit (ad_astra:jet_suit). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012CF18CEC3E4.title": "Obtain 1 × Unconventional Flight",
  "quest.513011797B8A9790.title": "Obtain 1 × Unconventional Flight",
  "quest.513011797B8A9790.quest_desc": [
