  "chapter.5130106917F3C428.title": "26 · Avaritia: Final Industry",
  "chapter.5130106917F3C428.chapter_subtitle": [
    "30 quests · English objective guide (alpha).",
    "Short lines: sequence · hover a quest: other prerequisites",
    "Open a quest to inspect all prerequisites. Its map role does not change its completion conditions."
  ],
  "task.5130123D852822DE.title": "Obtain 1 × Compressed Crafting Table",
  "quest.513011406C235CDC.title": "Obtain 1 × Compressed Crafting Table",
  "quest.513011406C235CDC.quest_desc": [
    "The compressed table begins Re-Avaritia’s table progression. Fill a 3×3 grid with nine ordinary crafting tables to make a Compressed Crafting Table.",
    "Continue with the Double Compressed Crafting Table, then the specialised Sculk, Nether and End tables, and finally Extreme. Follow each recipe’s category and tier; the word “compressed” does not itself unlock a 9×9 grid.",
    "SOQM’s key late Avaritia recipes use EMC Core. Prepare the tables alongside the campaign’s material progression so both the required grid and its ingredients are ready."
  ],
  "task.51301290602AF72B.title": "Obtain 1 × Double Compressed Crafting Table",
  "quest.513011322353703F.title": "Obtain 1 × Double Compressed Crafting Table",
  "quest.513011322353703F.quest_desc": [
    "A Double Compressed Crafting Table uses 9 Compressed Crafting Tables, equivalent to 81 ordinary crafting tables. Stock planks and make these intermediate blocks in batches.",
    "This block appears in several specialised table recipes. The first Sculk Crafting Table also needs Echo Shards and sculk components; later tables use Nether and End resources."
  ],
  "task.513012F211FCC124.title": "Obtain 1 × Diamond Lattice",
  "quest.5130116C9E28AC95.title": "Obtain 1 × Diamond Lattice",
  "quest.5130116C9E28AC95.quest_desc": [
    "Diamond Lattice combines diamonds with Netherite Scrap. The installed Re-Avaritia provides a tier-1 recipe using 4 diamonds and 1 scrap, plus an ordinary 3×3 recipe using 8 diamonds and 1 scrap.",
    "Compare the available tables before making a large batch: a prepared specialised workshop reduces diamond consumption. Lattices feed Crystal Matrix Ingots and later equipment tiers."
  ],
  "task.513012ECA6E31A5B.title": "Obtain 1 × Crystal Matrix Ingot",
  "quest.51301121119D2BEF.title": "Obtain 1 × Crystal Matrix Ingot",
  "quest.51301121119D2BEF.quest_desc": [
    "Crystal Matrix Ingots use Diamond Lattices and Nether Stars. Avaritia’s tier-1 recipe needs 4 lattices and 2 stars; the ordinary 3×3 recipe uses 6 lattices and 3 stars per ingot.",
    "Establish a repeatable Nether Star supply before scaling up. Reserve Crystal Matrix for tables, collectors and the compressor before spending the first batch on side equipment."
  ],
  "task.513012BCEF3F5D3F.title": "Obtain 1 × Extreme Crafting Table",
  "quest.513011CB9674DBF8.title": "Obtain 1 × Extreme Crafting Table",
  "quest.513011CB9674DBF8.quest_desc": [
    "The Extreme Crafting Table provides Avaritia’s tier-4 recipes on a 9×9 grid. The table itself uses a tier-3 recipe on a 7×7 grid, so prepare an End Crafting Table first.",
    "SOQM’s modified recipe also needs EMC Core, Crystal Matrix, Diamond Lattice, a Double Compressed Crafting Table and rare expedition components. Assemble the complete current recipe’s ingredients before crafting.",
    "The finished table handles late recipes for the Philosopher’s Stone, Transmutation Table, Neutronium Collector and Infinity Ingot. Place component reserves nearby and leave room to remove outputs."
  ],
  "task.5130123C8B47BF84.title": "Obtain 1 × Neutronium Collector",
  "quest.5130116C6474BE0E.title": "Obtain 1 × Neutronium Collector",
  "quest.5130116C6474BE0E.quest_desc": [
    "A Neutronium Collector gradually produces Neutron Piles. Place it in a loaded area, wait for the first completed cycle and arrange extraction; a full working output stops useful production.",
    "SOQM crafts the collector on the 9×9 table using Crystal Matrix, iron, quartz and redstone blocks, plus EMC Core. This is passive neutron-material production, separate from Mekanism reactors.",
    "Test one collector and your ingot demand before mass construction. Account for material compression: 9 piles → 1 nugget, 9 nuggets → 1 ingot."
  ],
  "task.51301221B7432592.title": "Obtain 1 × Neutronium Ingot",
  "quest.51301169390FCFD0.title": "Obtain 1 × Neutronium Ingot",
  "quest.51301169390FCFD0.quest_desc": [
    "A Neutron Ingot uses 9 Neutron Nuggets, or 81 Neutron Piles. Evaluate collector throughput at that full cost when estimating how long a batch will take.",
    "Ingots feed the Neutronium Compressor, gears and Infinity Ingots. Keep a small reserve for the production line itself so spending the last ingot does not delay its next upgrade."
  ],
  "task.5130122294C294E1.title": "Obtain 1 × Neutronium Nugget",
  "quest.51301163B5422470.title": "Obtain 1 × Neutronium Nugget",
  "quest.51301163B5422470.quest_desc": [
    "Fill a 3×3 grid with nine Neutron Piles to make a Neutron Nugget. Nine nuggets then compress into one Neutron Ingot.",
    "Reserve some nuggets for Ultimate Stew and Cosmic Meatballs. Those recipes use nuggets specifically, so the entire supply need not remain compressed into ingots."
  ],
  "task.5130127D0298A429.title": "Obtain 1 × Pile of Neutrons",
  "quest.5130112A1F7D2FE4.title": "Obtain 1 × Pile of Neutrons",
  "quest.5130112A1F7D2FE4.quest_desc": [
    "A Neutron Pile is the basic collector’s first product. Take it from the output to complete the item objective and begin a compression stockpile.",
    "Nine piles make one nugget. One ingot needs 81 piles, so establish extraction and storage before accepting a large production order."
  ],
  "task.513012408ECC4A38.title": "Obtain 1 × Neutronium Gear",
  "quest.513011D735C27FBE.title": "Obtain 1 × Neutronium Gear",
  "quest.513011D735C27FBE.quest_desc": [
    "A Neutronium Gear uses 4 Neutron Ingots around 1 Crystal Matrix Ingot in an ordinary 3×3 grid. Prepare both material lines before batch crafting.",
    "Gears are used in advanced collectors and compressors. Choose an upgrade first and count the previous-tier machines in its recipe; one new gear does not complete the whole upgrade."
  ],
  "task.51301299D19DCFFD.title": "Obtain 1 × Dense Neutronium Collector",
  "quest.5130119CA3A263C4.title": "Obtain 1 × Dense Neutronium Collector",
  "quest.5130119CA3A263C4.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Dense Neutronium Collector (avaritia:dense_neutron_collector). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012987EABBDB2.title": "Obtain 1 × Denser Neutronium Collector",
  "quest.513011DEA6334875.title": "Obtain 1 × Denser Neutronium Collector",
  "quest.513011DEA6334875.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Denser Neutronium Collector (avaritia:denser_neutron_collector). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.5130125D32EEAFC7.title": "Obtain 1 × Densest Neutronium Collector",
  "quest.5130118925371479.title": "Obtain 1 × Densest Neutronium Collector",
  "quest.5130118925371479.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Densest Neutronium Collector (avaritia:densest_neutron_collector). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012F52B8CBC3B.title": "Obtain 1 × Neutronium Compressor",
  "quest.513011C1CC3201F5.title": "Obtain 1 × Neutronium Compressor",
  "quest.513011C1CC3201F5.quest_desc": [
    "A Neutronium Compressor processes large batches of specified materials through compressor recipes, including Avaritia singularities. Check the required material, quantity and processing time for each output.",
    "Feed a small quantity of the correct ingredient first, verify the selected recipe, then connect bulk delivery. Check the stored input and recipe lock before changing the product.",
    "AE2 Singularities and Avaritia’s material singularities are different items. Infinity Catalyst needs the components in its current recipe, not any item named Singularity."
  ],
  "task.5130126DACAEAE26.title": "Obtain 1 × Infinity Ingot",
  "quest.5130114AEE1EEE9F.title": "Obtain 1 × Infinity Ingot",
  "quest.5130114AEE1EEE9F.quest_desc": [
    "An Infinity Ingot combines Crystal Matrix Ingots, Neutron Ingots, Infinity Catalysts and EMC Core on Avaritia’s 9×9 table. Preparing repeatable catalyst production alongside neutron materials is the demanding part.",
    "Treat the Infinity Catalyst recipe as a production plan of its own: establish its required singularities and other components before requesting final ingot batches.",
    "Keep the first ingot for the Main Route’s finale until its inventory check completes. Item objectives do not consume it; afterwards, use the material for your chosen equipment."
  ],
  "task.51301262C60119CA.title": "Obtain 1 × Infinity Helmet",
  "quest.5130114285BDA854.title": "Obtain 1 × Infinity Helmet",
  "quest.5130114285BDA854.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Infinity Helmet (avaritia:infinity_helmet). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012FEE02E16A8.title": "Obtain 1 × Infinity Chestplate",
  "quest.51301198EC7D0BCB.title": "Obtain 1 × Infinity Chestplate",
  "quest.51301198EC7D0BCB.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Infinity Chestplate (avaritia:infinity_chestplate). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012C931D56521.title": "Obtain 1 × Infinity Pants",
  "quest.513011312954C9E1.title": "Obtain 1 × Infinity Pants",
  "quest.513011312954C9E1.quest_desc": [
    "Have in your inventory 1 × Infinity Pants (avaritia:infinity_pants). The items are not consumed by this task."
  ],
  "task.513012C9CE284E20.title": "Obtain 1 × Infinity Boots",
  "quest.5130118D15404A4E.title": "Obtain 1 × Infinity Boots",
