    "Unlock the sixth skill in any ONE of the four Mayhem branches. This is an OR condition; all four final skills are not required."
  ],
  "task.514012AEB64D79CB.title": "Obtain Industrial Chassis",
  "quest.514011E9C8CE8643.title": "Skill Points for Industrial Chassis",
  "quest.514011E9C8CE8643.quest_desc": [
    "Obtain Industrial Chassis for its one-time two-point Pufferfish's Skills bonus. It is tied to the player and material: moving it repeatedly, relogging or farming normal XP does not grant extra bonuses."
  ],
